{
  "id": "testv3.beta",
  "title": {
    "zh": "v3 组件乙",
    "en": "v3 widget beta"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "新把手第二个目录里的沙箱组件：与组件甲声明同一份能力面、同一份数据源白名单，用来核对两种写法的语义是否一致。",
    "en": "The sandbox widget in the new handle's second directory: the same capability surface and source whitelist as alpha, so both ways of writing a widget can be compared."
  },
